Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(web): keep whole-stack viewer actions after asset
 updates

Asset updates pushed by the server carry no stack summary. After one
replaced the asset on screen, for example after adding it to an album,
whole-stack viewer actions acted on that asset alone. The navigation bar
now falls back to the stack the viewer loaded.

The marked-set E2E test also waits for the viewer to show the next asset
before marking it.
